OL,3,GNEWSAPumpkin carver's 'terrifying'
OL,4,ATrump portrait goes viral
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pumpkin carver who creates portraits
OL,7,Fof "terrifying people" has become a
OL,8,Fviral hit for depicting the likes of
OL,9,FDonald Trump and Vladimir Putin.
OL,11,FJamie Jones, 42, from Capenhurst,
OL,12,FChester, started pumpkin carving 12
OL,13,Fyears ago and honed his skills by
OL,14,Fpractising on 30 to 40 pumpkins each
OL,15,Fyear "until his fingers bled".
OL,17,FJamie creates three-dimensional designs
OL,18,Fby shaving layers off the pumpkin's
OL,19,Fsurface rather than cutting shapes out
OL,20,Fof it.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
