OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite working full-time as an events
OL,7,Fand media sales manager, he can earn up
OL,8,Fto #20,000 a year from his Halloween
OL,9,Fside-hustle, and launched his business,
OL,10,FPumpkin Freak, in 2020, going on to
OL,11,Fwork with brands including Pets at Home
OL,12,Fand Warner Bros.
